        "color": 6,
        "width": 620,
        "height": 180,
        "content": "# Demo only — no customer data\nRun **Run Safe Sample** manually. The next node creates four synthetic requests. Replace the sample generator only after defining real data authorization and checking privacy/compliance. No credentials, webhooks, network requests, emails, or CRM writes are configured."
      }
