        "height": 170,
        "content": "# Test results and routing\nFour synthetic examples: **1 qualified** (still requires human approval), **2 manual review** (missing fields), **1 do not contact** (no permission). Unknown categories are sent to an Investigate fallback. The workflow deliberately does not send messages or write to external systems."
      }
